\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces FloodNet Class Distribution: Demonstrating the acute spatial imbalance where critical infrastructure classes (flooded roads, vehicles) comprise less than 3\% of total imagery.}}{23}{figure.4.1}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces Class-Balanced Sampling and Multi-Objective DiceFocalLoss Mechanism: Coupling inverse square-root class-frequency sampling with focal hard-example mining and soft Dice overlap optimization.}}{26}{figure.4.2}%
